@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam padding 8
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

title Arquitectura Granular: IAM Component v3.1\nIdentity and Access Management - Versiones Actualizadas (Abril 2026)

' --- PALETA DE COLORES ---
!define COLOR_GO     #00ADD8
!define COLOR_ORY    #5528FF
!define COLOR_FGA    #FF6B35
!define COLOR_DB     #CFD8DC
!define COLOR_NATS   #27AE60
!define COLOR_FRONT  #F5F5F5

skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor<<Go>>  COLOR_GO
  FontColor<<Go>>        white
  BackgroundColor<<Ory>> COLOR_ORY
  FontColor<<Ory>>       white
  BackgroundColor<<FGA>> COLOR_FGA
  FontColor<<FGA>>       white
  BackgroundColor<<Ext>> COLOR_FRONT
  BorderColor<<Ext>>     #BDBDBD
}

skinparam database {
  BackgroundColor<<Storage>> COLOR_DB
  BorderColor<<Storage>>     #78909C
}

skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor transparent
  BorderColor     #455A64
  BorderStyle     dashed
}

' --- ACTORES EXTERNOS AL IAM ---
component "Traefik v3.x ForwardAuth\ny CF Workers Hono v4.x BFF" <<Ext>> as External
component "NATS JetStream v2.11.x\nnats.go v1.50.0\nEvent Bus Global" <<Ext>> as NATS
component "Scheduling, Clinical\ny demas Servicios\nGo 1.25.x" <<Ext>> as CoreServices

' --- IAM BOUNDED CONTEXT ---
rectangle "IAM Bounded Context - Microservicio Aislado" {

  component "IAM Domain Service\nGo 1.25.x + Chi v5.x + pgx v5\n--\nOrquestador de Identidad.\nEnriquece JWTs con UUIDv7.\nGestiona DIDs (did:web).\nPublica eventos via Outbox.\ngolang-migrate v4.x" <<Go>> as GoIAM

  rectangle "Ory Stack - Autenticacion" {
    component "Ory Kratos v1.3.1\nAuthN\n--\nPasskeys WebAuthn.\nGestion de Sesiones y MFA.\nCero contrasenas por defecto.\nFlows self-service.\nSAML + OIDC disponibles." <<Ory>> as Kratos
  }

  rectangle "OpenFGA v1.x - Autorizacion Zanzibar" {
    component "OpenFGA v1.x\nAuthZ\n--\nMotor Zanzibar (Google).\nRelation Tuples tipadas.\nDSL de modelado expresivo.\nBacking: Okta/Auth0.\nPlayground: play.fga.dev\nApache 2.0 | $0 self-hosted" <<FGA>> as OpenFGA
  }

  rectangle "IAM Database Cluster - PostgreSQL 17.4" {

    database "Kratos DB\n(PostgreSQL 17.4)\n--\nCredenciales y hashes.\nSesiones activas.\nIdentity schemas.\nEsquema interno Ory Kratos." <<Storage>> as DB_Kratos

    database "OpenFGA DB\n(PostgreSQL 17.4)\n--\nRelation Tuples.\nGrafos de permisos.\nStore ID por organizacion.\nConsistencia configurable." <<Storage>> as DB_OpenFGA

    database "IAM Domain DB\n(PostgreSQL 17.4)\n--\nOutbox Table para NATS.\nPerfiles de usuarios.\nUUIDv7 como PK (PG17 nativo).\nRLS Policies activas." <<Storage>> as DB_Domain

  }
}

' --- FLUJOS DE COMUNICACION ---

' 1. Flujo de Login
External -down-> Kratos : "1. Challenge Passkey / WebAuthn\n(FIDO2 / WebAuthn Level 3)"
Kratos -down-> DB_Kratos : "Verifica Credencial FIDO2\npgx v5 pgxpool"
Kratos -up-> External : "Set-Cookie / Session Token\n(CSRF protegido)"

' 2. Flujo de Acceso Autenticado
External -down-> GoIAM : "2. Peticion autenticada\nSession Token en header"
GoIAM -left-> Kratos : "Verifica Sesion activa\n(Kratos Admin API :4434)"
GoIAM -right-> OpenFGA : "Check: can doctor:X\nwrite on clinical_record:Y?"
OpenFGA -down-> DB_OpenFGA : "Evalua Grafo de Relaciones\npgx v5 pgxpool"

' 3. Persistencia y Outbox
GoIAM -down-> DB_Domain : "TX atomica:\nInserta Perfil + Outbox Event\nEN MISMA TRANSACCION PG"

' 4. Emision de Eventos
DB_Domain .up.> NATS : "Outbox Worker\nnats.go v1.50.0\nPublica [UserRegistered]\n[DoctorOnboarded]"
NATS ..> CoreServices : "Distribuye eventos\na toda la clinica"

' 5. Verificacion en otros servicios
CoreServices .left.> GoIAM : "Valida JWT Ed25519\nvia clave publica\n(verificacion asincrona)"

' --- NOTAS ---
note right of GoIAM
  **El JWT Enriquecido (Ed25519):**
  GoIAM toma la sesion de Kratos,
  inyecta UUIDv7 + rol + tenant_id
  y firma con clave Ed25519.
  
  golang-jwt/jwt v5.x para firma.
  google/uuid v1.6+ para UUIDv7.
  
  Claims del JWT:
    sub:       UUIDv7 del usuario
    role:      doctor|patient|admin
    tenant_id: UUIDv7 de la org
    did:       did:web:sereni.dad:...
    iat / exp: timestamps RFC 3339
  
  Este JWT alimenta el RLS de
  todos los PostgreSQL del sistema
  via SET LOCAL app.user_id = ...
end note

note right of OpenFGA
  **Paradigma Zanzibar (DSL v1.1):**
  No guardas "Rol = Doctor".
  Guardas tuplas de relacion:
  
  type clinical_record
    relations
      define patient: [patient]
      define can_read:  owner or can_write
      define can_write: [doctor]
  
  Tuple:
  {user: "doctor:X",
   relation: "can_write",
   object: "clinical_record:hc-001"}
  
  Check: can doctor:X can_write
  on clinical_record:hc-001? YES
  
  Escala a millones de relaciones.
end note

note bottom of OpenFGA
  **Cambio ADR-004:**
  OpenFGA v1.x reemplaza Ory Keto.
  Misma semantica Zanzibar.
  DSL mas expresivo para
  relaciones medicas complejas.
  Open Source: Apache 2.0.
  SDK Go: github.com/openfga/go-sdk
end note

note bottom of DB_Domain
  **Outbox Pattern - Garantia:**
  1. INSERT clinical_event
  2. INSERT outbox_event
  Ambos en MISMA TX PostgreSQL.

  Si NATS falla: el outbox
  reintenta hasta publicar.
  Garantia: at-least-once.

  Consumidores: idempotentes
  (deduplicar por event_id UUIDv7).
end note

' ==========================================================
' ORDEN DE IMPLEMENTACION — IAM Bounded Context
' Ref: plans/05_orden_implementacion_capas_exhaustivo.md
'      plans/05b_orden_implementacion_capas_detalle.md
' ==========================================================
note as IAMOrderNote
  **ORDEN DE IMPLEMENTACION — IAM**

  FASE 1 — Subcapa 1.E: Ory Kratos v1.3.1
    Prereq: CloudNativePG (1.C) - kratos_db lista
    Artefactos: HelmRelease ory/kratos, kratos.yml,
    identity schemas (patient.json, doctor.json)
    Criterio: GET /health/ready -> {"status":"ok"}
              Passkey flow funciona desde browser

  FASE 1 — Subcapa 1.F: IAM Domain Service Go
    Prereq: 1.C (iam_db), 1.D (Protobuf), 1.E (Kratos)
    Artefactos: services/iam/ completo, JWT Ed25519,
    Outbox worker, Deployment + Service k8s,
    Traefik ForwardAuth Middleware configurado
    Criterio: POST /api/iam/token/exchange emite JWT
              GET /internal/validate-token -> 200

  FASE 3 — Subcapa 3.A: OpenFGA v1.x
    Prereq: 1.C (openfga_db), 1.F (IAM Domain Service)
    Artefactos: HelmRelease openfga/openfga,
    authorization model DSL v1.1, IAM Service integrado
    Criterio: Check API responde en <5ms P99
              Modelo medico validado en play.fga.dev

  NOTA: Traefik ForwardAuth Middleware (1.B) se
  configura junto con IAM Domain Service (1.F).
  Equivalente funcional de Caddy forward_auth.
end note

@enduml
